# Clean-state checklist (clock-out)

- [ ] Build passes.
- [ ] All tests pass, including tests that existed before this session.
- [ ] Feature state reflects what is actually verified (set by the check, not by hand).
- [ ] `harness/progress.md` updated: done, checks run, evidence, risks, next step.
- [ ] No half-finished step left undocumented; nothing uncommitted.
- [ ] No debug logs, temp files, commented-out code, ownerless TODOs, leftover containers or ports.
- [ ] Standard setup and start still work.
- [ ] The next session can continue without manual repair.
